ation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8DenseOpenSet}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(D,P,\\leq)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8DenseOpenSet}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing2\\text{-}open\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2OpenDenseSubset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing2\\text{-}open\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2OpenDenseSubset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary forcing density definition.</li>\n<li>Dense-open variants are merged here; plain dense subsets remain in <code>58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends